  "referenceCode": "const assetPathPrefix = \"LOCAL_FIGMA_ASSET_PREFIX\";\nconst imgSignal = `${assetPathPrefix}/809b3.svg`;\nconst imgChevronLeftTeal = `${assetPathPrefix}/f7363.svg`;\n\nexport default function ProtoDarkMagenta83EvPointStylePrivacyData() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"bg-[#20162e] border border-[#493d55] border-solid overflow-clip relative rounded-[17px] size-full\" data-node-id=\"249:7962\" data-name=\"PROTO / Dark + Magenta / 83 / EVPoint-style Privacy & Data\">\n      <div className=\"absolute backdrop-blur-[20px] bg-[#20162e] h-[44px] left-[25px] right-[28px] top-[-1px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7963\" data-name=\"iOS / Status Bar • Components\">\n        <div className=\"absolute inset-[31.82%_80.37%_27.27%_5.31%] overflow-clip\" data-node-id=\"I249:7963;126:7890\" data-name=\"Action\">\n          <p className=\"-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-['SF_Pro_Text:Semibold'] leading-[normal] left-[27px] not-italic text-[15px] text-center text-white top-[calc(50%-9px)] tracking-[-0.165px] w-[54px]\" data-node-id=\"I249:7963;126:7891\">\n            9:41\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute h-[14px] overflow-clip right-[14px] top-[calc(50%+1px)] w-[68px]\" data-node-id=\"I249:7963;126:7892\" data-name=\"Container\">\n          <SFSymbol>{`Image(systemName: \"battery.100percent\")`}</SFSymbol>\n          <div className=\"absolute inset-[11.43%_74.12%_12.14%_0.74%]\" data-node-id=\"I249:7963;126:7894\" data-name=\"Signal\">\n            <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgSignal} />\n          </div>\n          <SFSymbol>{`Image(systemName: \"wifi\")`}</SFSymbol>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"absolute h-[34px] left-[26px] right-[27px] top-[882px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7964\" data-name=\"iOS / Home Indicator • Components\">\n        <div className=\"-translate-x-1/2 absolute bg-white bottom-[8px] h-[5px] left-[calc(50%+0.5px)] rounded-[100px] w-[134px]\" data-node-id=\"I249:7964;126:2469\" data-name=\"Home Indicator\" />\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[53px] justify-center leading-[0] left-[70px] text-[23px] text-white top-[74.5px] w-[333px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7965\">\n        <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Privacy Policy</p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"[word-break:break-word] absolute bg-[#20162e] h-[752px] leading-[0] left-[-1px] overflow-x-clip overflow-y-auto top-[113px] w-[430px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7966\" data-name=\"Scrollable policy content / editable\">\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[39px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[12px] text-[color:var(--parkey-action-primary,#840561)] top-[21.5px] w-[385px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7967\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">DRAFT PREVIEW — NOT A PUBLISHED POLICY</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Regular'] font-normal h-[152px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[16px] top-[123px] w-[384px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7968\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">At Parkey, we want to explain how personal information may be used to deliver parking discovery services. This layout is a design preview; final collection and retention practices require privacy and legal review.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[48px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[22px] text-white top-[235px] w-[384px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7969\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Information We Collect</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Medium'] font-medium h-[27px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[17px] top-[288.5px] w-[19px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7970\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">•</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[31px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[16px] text-white top-[290.5px] w-[335px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7971\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Device Information</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Regular'] font-normal h-[94px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[14px] top-[352px] w-[338px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7972\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">The service may receive device and operating system information needed for compatibility, diagnostics and security.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Medium'] font-medium h-[27px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[17px] top-[424.5px] w-[19px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7973\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">•</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[31px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[16px] text-white top-[426.5px] w-[335px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7974\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Usage Information</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Regular'] font-normal h-[94px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[14px] top-[488px] w-[338px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7975\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">App interactions may help improve discovery features, search results and the usability of the service.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Medium'] font-medium h-[27px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[17px] top-[560.5px] w-[19px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7976\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">•</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[31px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[16px] text-white top-[562.5px] w-[335px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7977\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Account Information</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Regular'] font-normal h-[94px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[14px] top-[624px] w-[338px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7978\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Information voluntarily entered during account creation, such as a name, email or phone number, may be needed for sign-in.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Medium'] font-medium h-[27px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[17px] top-[696.5px] w-[19px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7979\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">•</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[31px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[16px] text-white top-[698.5px] w-[335px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7980\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Optional Profile Data</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Regular'] font-normal h-[94px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[14px] top-[760px] w-[338px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7981\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Vehicle category, city, occupation and parking preferences are optional and should remain editable.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Medium'] font-medium h-[27px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[17px] top-[832.5px] w-[19px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7982\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">•</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[31px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[16px] text-white top-[834.5px] w-[335px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7983\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Location Information</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Regular'] font-normal h-[94px] justify-center left-[47px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[14px] top-[896px] w-[338px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7984\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">With permission, location can help find nearby parking. Permission can be reviewed in device settings.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[45px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[22px] text-white top-[987.5px] w-[383px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7985\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">How We Use Your Information</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:Medium'] font-medium h-[145px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[#d1cad9] text-[16px] top-[1090.5px] w-[383px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7986\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">Possible uses include providing requested features, protecting accounts, improving service reliability and responding to user support requests. Final terms must be approved before launch.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"-translate-y-1/2 absolute flex flex-col font-['Outfit:SemiBold'] font-semibold h-[59px] justify-center left-[23px] text-[13px] text-[color:var(--parkey-action-primary,#840561)] top-[1210.5px] w-[383px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7987\">\n          <p className=\"leading-[normal]\">This is sample design content, not a legally operative privacy policy.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <a className=\"absolute bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0)] block cursor-pointer left-[14px] size-[48px] top-[49px]\" data-node-id=\"249:7988\" data-name=\"Parkey / Shared Back\">\n        <div className=\"absolute left-[12px] size-[24px] top-[12px]\" data-node-id=\"I249:7988;243:5478\" data-name=\"Chevron left / teal\">\n          <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgChevronLeftTeal} />\n        </div>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\nSUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n\nNode ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`.\nThese styles are contained in the design: Frosted Glass: Effect(type: BACKGROUND_BLUR, radius: 40).\nComponent descriptions: The following components have usage descriptions or documentation links defined in Figma. These descriptions provide important context about the intended usage, best practices, and any constraints for each component. Follow these guidelines when implementing or using these components.\n\n## Parkey / Navigation / Back\n**Node ID:** 243:5477\n\nCanonical Parkey back control: 48 × 48 px invisible touch target, teal chevron centered at (12,12), positioned at x=15 y=50 within a 430×932 screen. Apply navigation reactions to the INSTANCE, not the master. Use on all screen-level top-left back actions; no Back on top-level app home/splash.\nThe generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."
